        {
          "name": "count_cards",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:269312ac15371f98063ffebc438211b6d9a602d73656115773f4fe69acbad1a5",
          "description": "Count cards matching the given filters. Use this for questions like 'how many ruby cards are there?' or 'how many evasive characters?'. Supports stat ranges: min_attack/max_attack, min_defence/max_defence, min_cost/max_cost. Use keyword to filter by Lorcana keyword (Bodyguard, Challenger, Evasive, Reckless, Resist, Rush, Shift, Singer, Sing Together, Support, Vanish, Voiceless, Ward, etc.) — matches against the structured ability list. Use body_text for value-specific keyword queries like 'Singer 5' or 'Resist +2', or for non-keyword phrases like 'gain 2 lore'. Use lore/min_lore/max_lore to filter by lore value. Use card_type to filter by card type: Character, Action, Item, Song, or Location. Use set_code to filter by set number (e.g. '1' for The First Chapter). Use set_name to filter by set name as a case-insensitive substring (e.g. 'Wilds Unknown', 'frozen') — preferred when the user names a set in plain English. Color must be one of: ruby, sapphire, emerald, amber, amethyst, steel.",
