          "description": "Render a Lorcana deck as a Dreamborn/Pixelborn-compatible text deck list (`<count> <full_name>` per line, no sections, no set codes). Each entry is `{name: str, count: int}` where `name` is the card's `full_name` from search_cards (e.g. 'Mickey Mouse - Brave Little Tailor'). Returns plain text suitable for pasting into Dreamborn, Pixelborn, untap.in, or a Limitless tournament submission.",
