        {
          "name": "import_deck",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:19dd6e72eb47af1a3c55b910824aac5fa1e4ff95b1d970827ac44da06f63768d",
          "description": "Parse a Dreamborn/Pixelborn-style deck list (`<count> <full_name>` per line) into resolved card objects. Each line is matched to a card by exact full_name first; lines that don't match exactly are returned in `unresolved` with the top fuzzy candidates so the user can disambiguate. Returns `{parsed: [{count, card}], unresolved: [{raw, candidates}]}`. Blank lines, comments (`#`, `//`), totals (`Total: 60`), and bracketed section headers are silently skipped.",
